    "text": "Given <math><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5.0</mn><mo>±</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10.0</mn><mo>±</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math>What is total resistance in parallel with possible percentage error?"
